# rows-lit-ab-hover (H7): the pointer on the scale square (unit (2,-1) at
# page (1028,540)) lights the a and b rows; no rulers. Approached from empty
# plane, never from the diamond. (ea29aa9 dropped the old note: a direct
# diamond-to-square jump now leaves hovering true, cursor grab-hover, while a
# and b stay lit.)
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
query func=x2&h=1&k=-2&scale=0.5
wait 500
move 500 800
wait 300
move 1030 542
wait 300
shot rows-lit-ab-hover
